# Stein: a falling limestone chunk (Steinschlag) and the rock resting in its
# niche. Angular, faceted: lit top face i, side face m, d underside, k
# outline. Pale and jagged, never round or gold. The k outline box is the
# 12x12 hitbox (rows/cols 2-13); origin 8,14 = its bottom centre.
# rest = in the niche. wobble (telegraph) = the top tilts 1 px left, then
# 1 px right. fall = tumbling (a quarter turn between the frames, light
# kept top left).
sprite = stein
size   = 16x16
origin = 8,14
hitbox = 2,2,12,12
anim   = rest   frames=1
anim   = wobble frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = fall   frames=2 ticks=6 loop
